0..58 Comment "// A model that reads a port at its own scope\'s `Integer`."
59..61 Comment "//"
62..138 Comment "// A port reads the binding of the theory\'s source, and never the binding of"
139..214 Comment "// the model\'s source. A member that reads its own binding gives a value of"
215..231 Comment "// another type."
232..234 Comment "//"
235..311 Comment "// The port of `say` names `Integer` in the declaring source, where it names"
312..389 Comment "// the strings. This source sees the prelude\'s `Integer`. A member that gives"
390..467 Comment "// a prelude integer does not give the word that the port names, so the model"
468..482 Comment "// refuses it."
483..485 Comment "//"
486..501 Comment "// - see: #8139"
502..578 Comment "// - see: model/modules/port-sort-scope.gandr — the theory and its binding"
